            tips = listOf("Nothing is sent or deleted without your tap.", "Disconnect can also delete that account's mail data.", "In Needs you, Draft replies drafts a reply to each email for you to read; Send all then sends the short ones, each from its own account, with Undo.", "A renewal email (a subscription or policy about to renew) shows in Needs you under Renewals from your mail; Add puts it on Lists → Renewals with its day and price, Not needed clears it.", "A promise in an email (“I'll send it by Friday”) shows there too; Add puts it on Waiting for, chased the day after the day they gave.", "An email you sent asking something that's had no reply for 3 days shows there as No reply yet; Add puts it on Waiting for to chase, and it goes by itself once they answer.", "Some people take longer to answer: tap Wait 3 days on a No reply yet row and pick 1 day to 2 weeks for that person; their emails wait that long before Navilife offers a chase, on both apps.", "To see or change everyone you've set a wait for, open Mail settings: Chase waits lists each person with the same chips and Back to usual (3 days), with Undo.", "Once it's on Waiting for, Time to chase offers a short follow-up to send in the same conversation, to the people you wrote to, from the same account; nothing goes until you tap Send, and Undo stops it.", "With Navilife's AI on, tapping Chase writes the follow-up from your email (who, the subject, how long it's been) in your usual tone; change anything, tap Another draft for a different one, and still nothing goes until you tap Send.", "An email asking to meet says \"Asks to meet\" in Needs you; Suggest times opens the reply with three times you are free from your calendars, sent only when you tap Send.", "If they can't make the times you offered, their answer says so with Suggest times for other days; if their email says where they are (\"I'm in New York\"), the times are also written in their time and kept inside their working day.", "When they write back picking one of the times you offered, their email says \"Sam picked Tue 20 Oct, 13:00–14:00\"; Book it puts it in your calendar (Undo for five seconds), and nothing is sent to them.", "To have renewals and promises from your mail added for you, turn on Renewals and promises from mail in What Navilife may do; each one shows in Activity with Undo, and an undone one comes back to Needs you with Add."),
