            tips = listOf("Reflect (near the top) is a two-minute look back: what went well, what to drop, and one thing that matters next week. It opens by itself from Sunday 18:00 (or the time you choose) through Monday; any other time tap \"Reflect on your week\".", "The chips under each question come from your week (wins, things you ticked off, habits met, what's still open, your goals): tap one to add it. Type or use the keyboard's mic, then Save. One line in any of the three is enough.", "Saving keeps it in \"Your reflections\" (open it from an earlier week), adds what went well to Wins (untick \"Also keep in Wins\" to stop that) and, if you tapped a goal's chip for the one thing, makes it one of next week's goals. \"Skip this week\" puts it away until next Sunday.", "Say \"reflect on my week\" to Talk (on the phone or the Mac) and Review opens on this week (last week on a Monday) with Reflect open, any day. Nothing is kept until you tap Save.", "The one thing you said matters shows under Today's header all the next week (\"This week's one thing · …\", in brass on the Monday), and the morning brief says it on Monday (and every weekday on Standard and Full).", "To have the review and reflection come at another time on Sunday, tap Change beside \"Comes on Sundays at 18:00\" at the bottom of Reflect (on the Mac, pick the time there) and choose 16:00 to 21:00. The review's heads-up and Today's card move with it, on both apps.", "Not now on a Sunday? Tap \"Later tonight\" on Today's review card or on its notification: the card steps away and the review comes back two hours on (never after 22:00), on the phone and the Mac."),
